    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d661">

                <pb facs="1335" n="1323" sameAs="frus:frus1945v02/pg1323"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.4016/12–1245: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Poland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Lane</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Warsaw</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-12T15:00:00+01:00">December 12,
                            1945—3 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 9:10 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>658. My 646 [to] Dept.<anchor n="91" xml:id="d661-f1"/> Bentinck has shown me
                    telegram from London authorizing him to take action concurrently with me re
                    alleged mistreatment of Germans. As Bentinck was authorized and not instructed
                    to make representations he proposes like Nelson at bombardment of Copenhagen to
                    hold his telescope to his blind eye.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lane</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
